Initial commit: Fi-Plan Next.js port

Single Next.js app combining a React port of fi-plan-fe with an embedded
TypeScript re-implementation of findependence-core (clean architecture,
extractable server under src/server).

- App Router pages: login, onboarding, plan dashboard, compare, profile,
  shared templates, edit, forgot password, link page
- Embedded backend: domain/application/infrastructure/presentation/http/di,
  Mongo repositories, Google OAuth, Mailjet, session auth
- Engine ported server-side: statements, transactions, loans, plan snapshot
- Zustand store, chart.js, headless-ui components, mixpanel/sentry trackers

Co-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>
